  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coordination of MOST intergovernmental mechanisms and global normative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity contributes to enhancements of the competencies of the SHS sector in policy support and capacity-building for public policies in Member States, through evidence-informed advice, and working with the vast network of knowledge partners, intergovernmental mechanisms, governments and social actors. The interventions of programme will contribute to an effective and efficient functioning of the Intergovernmental council and scientific advisory committee and the undertaking of Annual MOST Forum and related knowledge events which position the MOST programme as a centre of excellence in human and social sciences. SHS will leverage on the links with policymakers embedded in the MOST programme and in the monitoring process of the 2017 Recommendation on Science and Scientific Researchers.</narrative>
  </description>
